#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:5 4d0b5e5c8028416fab28d5094d57d8aa
msgid "Basic FPV Plane"
msgstr "基础 FPV 固定翼飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:9 6c0dae41940a41fdb4ea06084c8d6d44
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:11 a6b9102d1ecb4f068282877b580b1e4b
msgid ""
"With ArduPilot (AP) it is possible to use a fully functional, powerful "
"autonomous flight system on inexpensive, highly integrated autopilot boards,"
" including onboard battery monitoring and an onboard OSD. Due to ArduPilot's"
" multitude of options and parameters, a first time setup may seem daunting. "
"This guide attempts to provide the necessary instructions to get airborn on "
"a typical ArduPlane setup with autonomous flight fleatures and is "
"intentionally focussing only a small part of what ArduPilot has to offer. "
"For a more in-depth explanation of flight features see the `full setup guide"
" <arduplane-setup.html>`__. ArduPilot's additional features and options "
"(terrain following, airspeed use, autoland features, logging, compass setup "
"etc.) are left for you to pursue in the future. The goal in here is to get "
"you in the air, mission capable, with a well flying plane that you can "
"expand on."
msgstr ""
"借助 ArduPilot（AP），可以在廉价的高度集成飞控板上使用功能完善的自主飞行系统，包括板载电池监控和 OSD。由于 ArduPilot "
"拥有众多选项和参数，初次配置可能令人望而生畏。本指南旨在提供在典型 ArduPlane 配置上实现自主飞行并升空所需的必要说明，并有意仅聚焦于 "
"ArduPilot 所提供功能的一小部分。更深入的飞行功能说明请参阅 `完整设置指南 <arduplane-"
"setup.html>`__。ArduPilot "
"的附加功能和选项（地形跟随、空速使用、自动降落功能、日志记录、罗盘设置等）留待您日后自行探索。本指南的目标是让您升空飞行，具备任务能力，拥有一架飞行性能良好的飞机，并可在此基础上进一步扩展。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:23 5a01c2cf530e4eaba3b86c921f089dce
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:25 3dd9bc7c5fc44fe09a11708ae66b26fc
msgid ""
"There are many choices and options for ArduPilot FCs, see `this list of "
"currently supported boards <common-autopilots.html>`__. Omnibus F4 Pro or "
"Matek F405-Wing are good choices for a basic FPV plane configuration, since "
"they integrate OSD and power module functions into one board. This guide "
"will assume a comparable integrated peripheral setup containing onboard "
"battery monitoring and OSD. Additionally, the following items are required:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 飞控有很多选择，请参阅 `当前支持的飞控板列表 <common-autopilots.html>`__。Omnibus F4 Pro"
" 或 Matek F405-Wing 是基础 FPV 固定翼配置的好选择，因为它们将 OSD "
"和电源模块功能集成在一块板上。本指南假设使用类似的集成外设配置，包含板载电池监控和 OSD。此外，还需要以下物品："

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:29 ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:70
#: 2591f8e3824748a79dee63be6e7594f9 6fc7055498184e58bd9fea3b543a13e9
msgid "GPS"
msgstr "GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:30 eff17c5dded54837ae3a19c5fae423d7
msgid "RX"
msgstr "接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:31 6332fec098d04f31ae72db16cfb9460c
msgid "ESC & Servos"
msgstr "ESC 与舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:32 6f31439f119c4bfda0945eff4882e218
msgid "VTX and Camera"
msgstr "图传和摄像头"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:35 6c996daefa384aab9230b65ccb870d78
msgid ""
"This guide presumes you are capable to correctly wire all components using "
"the readily available resources for the selected board. RCGroups provides "
"forums for hardware help on any of the supported boards. Other peripherals "
"(compass, pitot, telemetry, etc.) will not be covered here as they are not "
"necessarily required to get you in the air and flying. They can well be "
"added and configured in the future, subject to personal preferences."
msgstr ""
"本指南假设您能够利用所选飞控板的现有资源正确连接所有组件。RCGroups "
"提供了针对任何受支持飞控板的硬件帮助论坛。其他外设（罗盘、皮托管、数传等）不在本指南范围之内，因为它们并非升空飞行的必要条件，可在日后根据个人偏好添加和配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:42 3ca0a511a5cc416b9d9c9fd5f9045171
msgid "Software"
msgstr "软件"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:44 93dc34e1368540cdbb35b01273172102
msgid ""
"This is the part that likely gives potential new users the most concern, "
"that's why this guide will focus this."
msgstr "这是最可能让潜在新用户感到担忧的部分，因此本指南将重点介绍这一环节。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:47 99d247ac9c4e4c5b8379fc5503cea04b
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:49 56304c90f48d43949269f31e42f08503
msgid ""
"Commercially targeted boards like Pixhawk will usually already have some "
"version of ArduPilot loaded, along with an ArduPilot compatible bootloader "
"that will allow updating the firmware using Mission Planner or other GCS "
"software (ground control station) immediately. Boards like Omnibus F4 Pro "
"usually don't come with an ArduPilot bootloader by default, so you will need"
" to follow `this straight forward procedure to load ArduPilot on your board "
"for the first time <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-"
"boards.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk 等商业定向飞控板通常已预装某版本的 ArduPilot，并自带兼容 ArduPilot 的引导程序，可立即使用 Mission "
"Planner 或其他 GCS 软件（地面站）更新固件。Omnibus F4 Pro 等飞控板默认不带 ArduPilot 引导程序，因此需要按照 "
"`这个简单流程首次加载 ArduPilot <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-"
"boards.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:54 36699dd77516433c8cad832c37983303
msgid "Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:56 126d45415f6c4f50b2a2d78a88b04aea
msgid ""
"Mission Planner (MP) is a ground control station for AP, but also, the "
"primary tool for firmware updates and, most importantly, parameters "
"configuration. MP can be downloaded here: "
"https://ardupilot.org/planner/docs/mission-planner-overview.html"
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner（MP）是 AP 的地面站，也是固件更新的主要工具，最重要的是用于参数配置。MP "
"可在此下载：https://ardupilot.org/planner/docs/mission-planner-overview.html"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:59 21ada08b69364a5290b187781a390021
msgid ""
"There are alternatives,for non-PC users: "
"https://ardupilot.org/planner2/index.html"
msgstr "非 PC 用户的替代方案：https://ardupilot.org/planner2/index.html"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:62 6bff18df06424b2c9673d5afadd01ea7
msgid ""
"Once the firmware is installed and you are connected to MP or its "
"alternatives, software setup can be begin. Parameters may be changed "
"manually using the Configuration / Tuning Tabs."
msgstr "固件安装完成并连接到 MP 或其替代品后，即可开始软件配置。参数可通过「配置/调参」选项卡手动更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:65 da2a535214c24332a792505d7f50f5ad
msgid ""
"Note that some parameters can only be set while dis-armed, and that many "
"parameter groups are not visible until enabled and refreshed, such as the "
"RSSI and OSD parameter groups."
msgstr "请注意，某些参数只能在上锁状态下设置，且许多参数组在启用并刷新之前不可见，例如 RSSI 和 OSD 参数组。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:68 b0cf3cb8a9944e48ad70c5abe99afaa8
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:72 d5c2180a3c4d4a3c932700225e8c890c
msgid ""
"After connecting to MP, verify that your GPS is recognized and you "
"eventually get a satellite fix. Number of sats and HDOP are shown in the "
"Flight Data tab of MP. If no gps is detected, you will continue to see a "
"message in the HUD display stating \"No GPS\". If it detects it, it will "
"initially show \"GPS: No Fix\" until it obtains a lock."
msgstr ""
"连接 MP 后，确认 GPS 被识别并最终获得卫星定位。卫星数量和 HDOP 显示在 MP 飞行数据选项卡中。若未检测到 GPS，HUD "
"显示中将持续出现「No GPS」消息；若检测到 GPS，最初将显示「GPS: No Fix」，直至获得定位锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:75 0da7bcaa342c49558a7995cccf244308
msgid "That means you have hardware debug to do!"
msgstr "这意味着您需要进行硬件调试！"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:77 60d3487988c74c078a79e2a4aeac2b8b
msgid "Possible issues:"
msgstr "可能的问题："

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:79 5cd9819ebf9443a28d3cab8e9e994ce6
msgid ""
"Connected to wrong serial port (see your hardware docs for which port AP "
"expects) or incorrectly connected (TX/RX swapped)."
msgstr "连接到了错误的串口（请查阅硬件文档了解 AP 所需的端口），或连接错误（TX/RX 接反）。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:80 671d44b2e1f6443285a8f572da05f106
msgid ""
"Serial port settings were changed from default. ArduPlane expects GPS on "
"Serial 3 at 38.4Kbaud per default."
msgstr "串口设置已从默认值更改。ArduPlane 默认在串口 3 以 38.4K 波特率连接 GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:81 66962c340ce341878267f8283d0d96f3
msgid ""
"UBLOX, NMEA, and many other GPS receivers are supported by ArduPilot, but "
"your GPS receiver is not currently supported."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持 UBLOX、NMEA 及许多其他 GPS 接收机，但您的 GPS 接收机目前不受支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:84 96d36f163daa455aa394d79517c3fe6a
msgid ""
"The board's hardware UART number may NOT necessarily be the same as the "
"SERIAL port number in ArduPilot firmware / MP. See your respective board's "
"`hardware page <common-autopilots.html>`__ for wiring guides and UART to "
"SERIAL mapping. GPS defaults to SERIAL3 in the parameter listing and you "
"should not have to worry about UART mapping if you attach the GPS to the "
"port suggested in the wiring guide."
msgstr ""
"飞控板的硬件 UART 编号不一定与 ArduPilot 固件/MP 中的 SERIAL 端口编号相同。请参阅对应飞控板的 `硬件页面 <common-"
"autopilots.html>`__ 获取接线指南及 UART 到 SERIAL 的映射关系。GPS 在参数列表中默认为 "
"SERIAL3，若按接线指南将 GPS 连接到建议端口，无需担心 UART 映射问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:89 c287db9b3d8e4de89c7b32e8f8247bc3
msgid "Radio Calibration"
msgstr "遥控校准"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:91 dc0882ddcdf141dcb2c2d78445a73ed8
msgid ""
"Go to SETUP and move to Mandatory Hardware's Radio Calibration tab. You "
"should see the respective bars respond accordingly to your TX stick "
"movements for each input (pitch is opposite). If not, you have hardware "
"debug to do! ArduPilot expects AETR on channels 1-4 by default. Adjust your "
"TX channel assignments accordingly or alternatively use the RCMAP_n "
"parameters. You CAN change the direction of each input (ie reverse the "
"channel) with a check box in MP, if you cannot change it in your TX. Adjust "
"your TX subtrims to 1500uS for neutral as close as possible, perfection is "
"not required. The next step will compensate for residual offsets. However, "
"set the throttle trim such that at low throttle, it is 50-75uS GREATER than "
"its lowest value possible. This will be used to allow you to setup a "
"throttle failsafe value lower than your throttle stick's low position. After"
" this, NEVER adjust your TX trims or subtrims again, all further trim "
"procederes will be performed on your FC exclusively!"
msgstr ""
"进入 "
"SETUP，切换到「强制硬件」的「遥控校准」选项卡。拨动遥控器摇杆时，相应的进度条应正确响应各输入（俯仰方向相反）。若无响应，需进行硬件调试！ArduPilot"
" 默认在通道 1–4 使用 AETR 配置，请相应调整遥控器通道分配，或使用 RCMAP_n 参数进行更改。若无法在遥控器上更改方向，可在 MP "
"中通过勾选复选框反向各输入通道。将遥控器副配平调整为尽量接近 1500μs "
"中立，无需追求完美精度，下一步将补偿残余偏差。但油门配平应设置为比其最低可能值高 "
"50–75μs，以便将油门失控保护值设置低于油门摇杆的最低位置。此后，切勿再调整遥控器的配平或副配平，所有后续配平操作均应在飞控上进行！"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:101 5a3c08f26103478d9c89bdd5222a324b
msgid "Follow the RC Calibration steps as prompted."
msgstr "按提示完成遥控校准步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:103 61e6c3302c27478abd408a223b207da9
msgid "Flight Modes"
msgstr "飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:105 7962974881af4a0987e4be9fd7b74ca4
msgid ""
"Now setup your TX to provide the ability to output six different levels on "
"Channel 8. This will be your flight mode channel. (the default flight mode "
"channel can be adjusted by the :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` param, it "
"defaults to channel 8). See setup instructions `for various transmitters "
"<common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.html>`__. Now that the TX "
"can select 6 modes (usually using combining two three-position-switches), "
"set your flight modes for each switch position. It is strongly recommended "
"to initially use two positions for MANUAL mode, allowing you to \"bailout\" "
"to MANUAL no matter what position the second switch is in. It's a lot easier"
" to remember to just slam one switch down( or up) without worrying about the"
" state of the other mode switch. Then set the TX switches to produce the "
"following modes:"
msgstr ""
"现在在遥控器上设置，使其能在第 8 通道输出六个不同的电平，这将作为飞行模式通道（默认飞行模式通道可通过 "
":ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` 参数调整，默认为第 8 通道）。请参阅 `各遥控器的设置说明 <common-rc-"
"transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.html>`__。遥控器可选择 6 "
"种模式后（通常使用两个三档开关组合），为每个开关位置设置飞行模式。强烈建议初期将两个位置都设置为 MANUAL 模式，让您可以「紧急切出」到 "
"MANUAL，无论第二个开关处于何位置。这样只需猛地拨动一个开关（向上或向下），而无需关心另一个模式开关的状态。然后将遥控器开关设置为产生以下模式："

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:113 72d42c532f7d4c578819bfaa6c516f65
msgid "SW1  -  SW2  -  Mode"
msgstr "SW1  -  SW2  -  模式"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:115 6cbcb559b1064e33b9279293a383fb1b
msgid "Hi   -  Hi   -  Auto"
msgstr "高   -  高   -  Auto"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:117 5a486f794177497a9492ba361e531275
msgid "Hi   -  Mid  -  AutoTune (then Loiter after autotuning)"
msgstr "高   -  中   -  AutoTune（调参完成后改为 Loiter）"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:119 331477d411484d7b93289d86cb62674e
msgid "Hi   -  Lo   -  Manual"
msgstr "高   -  低   -  Manual"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:121 c27f4879cdcd486a9a3236c040b7cc17
msgid "Lo   -  Hi   -  Cruise"
msgstr "低   -  高   -  Cruise"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:123 a414c6d0d5464568b066944c0bb714bd
msgid "Lo   -  Mid  -  Stabilize (or FBWA)"
msgstr "低   -  中   -  Stabilize（或 FBWA）"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:125 39d0fd933e63498786bff56a33597a83
msgid ""
"Lo   -  Lo   -  Manual (low on SW2 ALWAYS drives Manual - that's your "
"bailout!)"
msgstr "低   -  低   -  Manual（SW2 低位始终切换到 Manual，这就是您的紧急退出！）"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:127 80aa79ebc5444b5792ec6a6d33969d8c
msgid ""
"Set these up in the Flight Modes subtab under SETUP -> Mandatory Hardware."
msgstr "在 SETUP -> 强制硬件 -> 飞行模式子选项卡中完成以上设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:129 af7461ea35e843a89171b5dc58c8b559
msgid ""
"After initial flights and tuning, you can change modes to whatever are "
"desired."
msgstr "初次飞行和调参完成后，可将模式改为任意所需模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:131 7630531e43cd41fbb3b3a0c4695ef145
msgid "Accel Calibration"
msgstr "加速度计校准"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:133 9cc9ec7faa9e4e6ba9cb0ab8839f1613
msgid ""
"Go to the SETUP -> Mandatory Hardware -> Accelerometer Calibration tab and "
"perform the full calibration. For the level position carefully level the "
"wings laterally, and have the wing chord set a few degrees (~ 3 deg) nose "
"up, since this is the normal cruise attitude for level flight for most "
"planes. This can be reset using the LEVEL only calibration button at any "
"time."
msgstr ""
"前往 SETUP -> 强制硬件 -> 加速度计校准选项卡，执行完整校准。水平位置时，仔细将机翼横向调平，并将翼弦设置为机头略微上仰几度（约 3 "
"度），因为这是大多数飞机在平飞时的正常巡航姿态。此操作可在任何时候通过「仅水平」校准按钮重置。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:138 79856d932ab2431b827cc3cbdef01a8a
msgid ""
"this can only change the difference between the autopilot's plane and "
"\"level\" by 10 degrees maximum. If more is needed (in the case that the "
"autopilot is mounted slightly downward, for example), then you can use "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` to alter the AOA manually. See "
":ref:`common-accelerometer-calibration` and :ref:`tuning-cruise` for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"此操作最多只能将飞控水平面与「水平」的差异更改 10 度。若需要更大的调整（例如飞控略微向下安装），可使用 "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` 手动调整迎角。详见 :ref:`common-accelerometer-"
"calibration` 和 :ref:`tuning-cruise`。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:140 9ef9978f3bda4666a83941d26a8f2cf5
msgid ""
"Also check that the orientation of the autopilot is correct. Moving the "
"plane should be correctly reflected in the HUD display of MP. Otherwise, you"
" will need to manually change the :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` "
"parameter appropriately and re-calibrate. A reboot is required after "
"changing this parameter."
msgstr ""
"还需确认飞控方向正确。移动飞机时，MP 的 HUD 显示应正确反映。否则需手动更改 "
":ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` 参数并重新校准，更改此参数后需重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:143 fe62e8052f16411d8e3d031008b66a98
msgid "Servo Functions"
msgstr "舵机功能"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:145 ac157e2f048a48518a66c0ea3cb13559
msgid ""
"Now configure the outputs of the FC to drive the servos and your ESC. This "
"is done using the SERVOx_FUNCTION params for however you want to connect "
"your equipment to the FC outputs: normal plane, v-tail, elevons, etc. You "
"should try to get the servo-arms centered when the channel driving it is in "
"neutral position if possible. You can tweak this using the SERVOx_TRIM "
"params. You can do this manually or via the SETUP -> Mandatory Hardware -> "
"Servo tab. You can also set the output range in this tab. Default is 1100 to"
" 1900uS. Depending on your individual airframe's requirements, these "
"endpoints can be adjusted. Values of 1000/2000uS usually provide full "
"throws."
msgstr ""
"现在配置飞控输出以驱动舵机和 ESC。根据您将设备连接到飞控输出的方式（普通固定翼、V 型尾翼、升降副翼等），使用 SERVOx_FUNCTION "
"参数进行配置。如可能，应尽量使舵机臂在驱动通道处于中立位时居中，可通过 SERVOx_TRIM 参数进行微调。此操作可手动完成，也可通过 SETUP "
"-> 强制硬件 -> 舵机 选项卡完成。在此选项卡中也可设置输出范围，默认为 1100 至 "
"1900μs。根据各机架的具体要求，可调整这些端点。1000/2000μs 的值通常能提供全行程。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:154 b94a2cae921f403a830c871afcf38f2c
msgid ""
"Now check that the servos move in the correct directions to level the plane "
"when moved around while in STAB or FBWA mode. Reverse the sevos with the "
"reverse box for a servo if needed. If you have correctly adjusted the TX "
"channel directions in part B above, then they will move in the correct "
"directions also in MANUAL mode."
msgstr ""
"现在检查在 STAB 或 FBWA 模式下移动飞机时，舵机是否向正确方向运动以调平飞机。若需要，为舵机勾选反向框。若在上面的步骤 B "
"中正确调整了遥控器通道方向，则在 MANUAL 模式下也应向正确方向运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:157 6683bd9e21034d04bb729a63d5a28952
msgid "OSD"
msgstr "OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:159 e791167043a7433fa62c752f8f91a6b1
msgid ""
"For autopilots with integrated OSDs, this should be automatically enabled. "
"You can use the Onboard OSD subtab in MP CONFIG tab to setup the display "
"configuration. Note that the elements of each OSD screen are visible only "
"after having enabled that screen and rebooting/reconnecting to the FC."
msgstr ""
"对于集成 OSD 的飞控，此功能应已自动启用。可在 MP 配置选项卡的「板载 OSD」子选项卡中设置显示配置。请注意，每个 OSD "
"屏幕的元素只有在启用该屏幕并重启/重新连接飞控后才可见。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:164 9456c2a13d8f49d58c9d978cc2144914
msgid "Receiver RSSI"
msgstr "接收机 RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:166 35be7e8e3e1b491ab699a8b0a534810b
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports either analog RSSI or PWM RSSI (also known as \"Digital "
"RSSI\") embedded in an RC channel. ArduPilot also supports RSSI provided "
"directly by the RC protocol (like CRSF). For analog (voltage-type), set "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` =1 and reboot, for PWM set "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` =2, and for RC protocol provided set "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` =3 . The remaining RSSI parameters will not "
"appear until this parameter is set and saved and your FC rebooted. For "
"Analog RSSi adjust these:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持模拟 RSSI 或嵌入在 RC 通道中的 PWM RSSI（也称为「数字 RSSI」），以及由 RC 协议（如 "
"CRSF）直接提供的 RSSI。对于模拟（电压型），设置 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` =1 并重启；对于 PWM，设置 "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` =2；对于 RC 协议提供的，设置 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` "
"=3。在设置并保存此参数并重启飞控之前，其余 RSSI 参数不会出现。对于模拟 RSSI，请调整以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:171 301ab4684f194146b3a1e19568a613a8
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` =x (see :ref:`this page for details "
"<common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication>`)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` =x（详见 :ref:`此页面 <common-rssi-received-"
"signal-strength-indication>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:173 5376815ca60b4679b9adcdf9391020ff
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_PIN_HIGH<RSSI_PIN_HIGH>` =3.3 (Note that most RSSI input pins are"
" tolerant only up to 3.3V)"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_PIN_HIGH<RSSI_PIN_HIGH>` =3.3（注意：大多数 RSSI 输入引脚最高只能承受 3.3V）"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:175 4ea0b44c81cb4100a3ff7a75c7584610
msgid ":ref:`RSSI_PIN_LOW<RSSI_PIN_LOW>` =0"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_PIN_LOW<RSSI_PIN_LOW>` =0"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:177 447c1df7bdd94a69afd2d277fb8396a5
msgid "For PWM adjust these parameters:"
msgstr "对于 PWM，请调整以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:179 7149e558aaf3478cb7e6d044ac41bde1
msgid ":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_HIGH<RSSI_CHAN_HIGH>` =2000"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_HIGH<RSSI_CHAN_HIGH>` =2000"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:181 d8b12a153b4343f7975e9420be1ab7eb
msgid ":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_LOW<RSSI_CHAN_LOW>` =1000"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_LOW<RSSI_CHAN_LOW>` =1000"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:183 9c9dd1d1f2814eb88edc3024162a8e26
msgid ":ref:`RSSI_CHANNEL<RSSI_CHANNEL>` =<channel that has RSSI pwm>"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_CHANNEL<RSSI_CHANNEL>` =<含 RSSI PWM 的通道>"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:186 1731142568bf42c6b74ecb0e2181d876
msgid ""
"RSSI can be monitored in MP by adding the user defined screen item in the "
"HUD view (right click): rxrssi."
msgstr "可通过在 HUD 视图中添加用户自定义屏幕项（右键点击）：rxrssi，在 MP 中监控 RSSI。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:188 e568899839b2483c971d73d51da4d7b1
msgid "Failsafe"
msgstr "失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:190 779682312dc94aa9a5a56e1e76d78427
msgid ""
"ArduPilot has many options for initiating failsafe. The only one of concern "
"for this guide is receiver failsafe. Failsafe will always be entered if the "
"RC input signal to the FC is lost. In addition, for Sbus-type receivers, "
"radio failsafe will be triggered by specific failsafe bits sent in the Sbus "
"output stream. For PPM-type receivers, you set the RX's failsafe to use "
"either throttle failsafe or no signal output ( DON'T USE HOLD!). Setting up "
"throttle failsafe is described `here <apms-failsafe-function.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 有许多触发失控保护的选项。本指南关注的唯一选项是接收机失控保护。若飞控的 RC 输入信号丢失，将始终进入失控保护。此外，对于 "
"Sbus 类型接收机，无线电失控保护将由 Sbus 输出流中发送的特定失控保护位触发。对于 PPM 类型接收机，将 RX "
"的失控保护设置为使用油门失控保护或无信号输出（请勿使用 HOLD！）。油门失控保护的设置方法详见 `这里 <apms-failsafe-"
"function.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:194 d17f2d9a5d624d07b33e97f6c4fd92b7
msgid ""
"The option to activate throttle failsafe by a separate TX switch that forces"
" the throttle channel to the failsafe value avoids having to set RTH as an "
"additional flight mode and is a good way to check faislafe behaviour while "
"flying."
msgstr ""
"通过单独的遥控器开关强制油门通道至失控保护值来触发油门失控保护，避免了将 RTH 设置为额外飞行模式的需要，同时也是飞行中检查失控保护行为的好方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:196 0336d7fcc2714804b055c768ffcd230f
msgid ""
"On the bench while connected to MP and with propellor removed, make sure "
"that FS is entered when you power off the TX."
msgstr "在地面连接 MP 并卸下螺旋桨的情况下，确认关闭遥控器时能进入失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:198 2662dfe8e29b4e549729cbb7d0c22984
msgid "Battery Monitor"
msgstr "电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:200 a7b4402418944951b90934fc4829619c
msgid ""
"Do NOT use the SETUP tab to setup the Battery Monitor for the newer Chibios "
"boards. These boards have the default configuration already loaded when "
"installing the firmware. You will probably have to slightly adjust the "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` and "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` parameters. "
"Most systems will draw 400 to 600 ma when the motor is not running. This is "
"set with the :ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"parameter. You can adjust the "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` parameter to "
"match the capacity used during your flight by taking the amount of current "
"you recharge the battery with, and the displayed amount of mah used using "
"the following formula:"
msgstr ""
"请勿使用 SETUP 选项卡为较新的 Chibios 飞控板设置电池监控。这些飞控板在安装固件时已加载了默认配置。您可能需要略微调整 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 和 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"参数。大多数系统在电机未运行时会消耗 400 至 600 mA，通过 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 参数设置。可按以下公式调整"
" :ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"参数，使其与飞行中实际使用的电量匹配："

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:209 2b91f3a1e72a47e5b81811491f8ee747
msgid ""
"new :ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = old "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` * MAH "
"-recharged/ MAH shown as used."
msgstr ""
"新 :ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 旧 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` × 实际充入 mAh / "
"显示已用 mAh。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:212 b422567392504cbc81f45d58cbb88165
msgid ""
"this isn't 100% accurate due to several factors, but is close enough. You "
"may have to iterate a few times. Also be sure to set the "
":ref:`BATT_CAPACITY<BATT_CAPACITY>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"由于多种因素，此方法并非 100% 精确，但足够接近，可能需要迭代几次。另外请务必设置 "
":ref:`BATT_CAPACITY<BATT_CAPACITY>` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:215 847030430f5f484ea187ac68a3d59dbe
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:217 250993020e1845f580ffdda6e35a1ce7
msgid ""
"Tradition fixed wing ArduPlane does not need a compass for good performance,"
"  as opposed to Copter or QuadPlane which require a compass for yaw "
"alignment. Even if you have a compass, disable it until you have everything "
"else working. Then you can expand to it. Uncheck \"Use this compass\" for "
"every compass in Mission Planner's SETUP/Compass screen."
msgstr ""
"传统固定翼 ArduPlane 无需罗盘也能获得良好性能，这与需要罗盘进行偏航对齐的 Copter 或 QuadPlane "
"不同。即使有罗盘，也应在其他一切正常工作之前禁用它，之后再启用。在 Mission Planner 的 SETUP/罗盘 "
"界面中取消勾选每个罗盘的「使用此罗盘」选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:221 8b3c4c44fb8c4b7a913da5707b0143ec
msgid "Airspeed"
msgstr "空速"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:223 b0f1c4705e3b46eebb16fe6ebb03bd31
msgid ""
"ArduPlane does not need an airspeed sensor for basic performance. A fairly "
"accurate synthetic airspeed estimate is calculated and gives good basic "
"performance. In order to display this in the OSD, you will need to set "
":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` =0. Feel free to add/enable a pitot sensor "
"later to improve cruise flight target airspeed precision, or automatic "
"landing airspeed control."
msgstr ""
"ArduPlane 无需空速传感器也能获得基本性能。系统会计算相当准确的合成空速估算值，可提供良好的基础性能。若要在 OSD 中显示此数据，需将 "
":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` =0。日后可添加/启用皮托管传感器，以改善巡航飞行目标空速精度或自动降落空速控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:226 7afee9ef3f9c4a709650fd263d322f78
msgid "Other Parameters"
msgstr "其他参数"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:229 2bd60c9027cc49a99b1619adf3703c54
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>` =1. This will automatically "
"adjust your servo trims as required for level flight. Unless you have your "
"mechanical trims WAY OFF, this eliminates the need to manually trim the "
"plane. You should never trim using the TX trims, as stated above."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>` "
"=1。这将自动调整舵机配平以维持平飞。除非机械配平偏差极大，否则无需手动配平飞机。如上所述，切勿使用遥控器配平。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:231 2523f255770e408da452379ff10ecc46
msgid ""
"If you have an overpowered plane, you might want to set "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` to value lower than 100%, ie 75%. Otherwise climbs "
"will be performed at max throttle, like during AUTOTAKEOFFs."
msgstr ""
"若飞机动力过剩，可将 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` 设为低于 100% 的值，如 75%，否则爬升（如自动起飞期间）将以最大油门进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:234 33053c06f95f4e4e833ca750c0b55284
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` to the expected cruise throttle. "
"Usually a little below midthrottle."
msgstr "将 :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` 设为预期的巡航油门，通常略低于中位油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:236 6d6a761f121a4b8b96657bcdd2c758d7
msgid ""
"If you have a small flying wing (like Z-84), it might be required to "
"decrease your default ``PTCH2SRV_P`` value if it is too aggressive and "
"causes flutter. In that case, reduce the default by half."
msgstr "若有小型飞翼（如 Z-84），可能需要降低默认 ``PTCH2SRV_P`` 值（若其过于激进导致抖振），将默认值减半即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:239 46550927d23f44a4bcd469deede69bc8
msgid ""
"ARMING: Leave all arming parameters at default. There is no reason to "
"disable these safety checks. You should be able to get a GPS lock even "
"indoors with modern GPS units. Inability to arm due to one of these checks "
"failing means something has to be corrected. This adds noticeable safety by "
"keeping you from accidentally starting your flight without your autopilot "
"being in a fully functional state."
msgstr ""
"解锁：保留所有解锁参数的默认值。没有理由禁用这些安全检查。即使在室内，现代 GPS 模块也能获得 GPS "
"锁定。因其中一项检查失败导致无法解锁，意味着需要纠正某些问题。这通过防止在飞控未完全正常工作的情况下意外开始飞行来增加显著的安全性。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:241 62d2fc63ad184991a80ad1e07cc257ba
msgid ""
"All other parameters can be left to default. However, after you get some "
"flights, you might want to play with: "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`, "
":ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>`, and "
":ref:`FBWB_CLIMB_RATE<FBWB_CLIMB_RATE>`. These are pretty docile at default "
"values."
msgstr ""
"其他所有参数均可保留默认值。但在完成一些飞行后，可能需要调整：:ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`、:ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>`"
" 和 :ref:`FBWB_CLIMB_RATE<FBWB_CLIMB_RATE>`。默认值较为保守。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:244 fdb9e5eab83b418ca9e7b46ee23e255d
msgid "ESC Calibration"
msgstr "ESC 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:246 2bef92f067be4c6a975e3a6a90e26172
msgid ""
"Calibration is easy. Remove prop. Power up on the bench with radio on using "
"USB. When GPS is locked, ARM the plane by giving full right rudder for a few"
" seconds and move throttle to high. Attach battery. When ESC beeps its "
"throttle set sequence, lower the throttle. Disconnect power, and re-attach "
"prop. If it does not arm, something has not been setup correctly above, or "
"(if you have an SD card for logging) the SD card is not inserted. Diagnostic"
" messages will be displayed on the OSD and in MP messages tab."
msgstr ""
"校准很简单。卸下螺旋桨。通过 USB 在地面台上给系统上电，打开遥控器。GPS "
"锁定后，将飞机解锁：将方向舵满右打并保持几秒，然后将油门推至最高。接上电池。当 ESC "
"发出油门设置完成的蜂鸣声后，将油门降低。断开电源，重新安装螺旋桨。若无法解锁，说明上述某些设置不正确，或（若有用于日志的 SD 卡）SD "
"卡未插入。诊断信息将显示在 OSD 和 MP 消息选项卡中。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:255 89ab4d91027f4e78a65cc25721f3ec1d
msgid "First Flight"
msgstr "首次飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:257 38edc050c5464bfcb5af7a1754a4909e
msgid ""
"First, go to the flight planner page of MP and create a waypoint anywhere, "
"set it to TAKEOFF type. Set it for 100 to 150ft altitude and pitch of no "
"more than 15deg for the first flight. Write it to the FC. Read back to make "
"sure it has been stored correctly. At the field, power the plane, check "
"again that all control surfaces move correctly accordingly to your TX stick "
"input in MANUAL mode, AND that when switched into STAB mode, the surfaces "
"move correctly to level the plane when you move it around."
msgstr ""
"首先，前往 MP 飞行规划页面，在任意位置创建一个航点，将其类型设为 TAKEOFF。为首次飞行设置 100 至 150 英尺的高度，俯仰角不超过 15"
" 度。写入飞控，读回以确认已正确存储。在飞行场地，给飞机上电，再次检查在 MANUAL 模式下所有操作面是否正确响应遥控器摇杆输入，并确认切换到 "
"STAB 模式后移动飞机时操作面是否正确运动以调平飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:264 349b85240b334755a543314652a29cd6
msgid ""
"THIS IS CRITICAL! Flying with control surface movement setup incorrectly "
"will result in a crash!"
msgstr "这一步至关重要！操作面运动方向设置错误将导致坠机！"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:266 c19977ab39914f13a9ce630a00432e2c
msgid ""
"Also recheck your battery is properly placed to for the desired CG. ARM the "
"plane and get ready to launch it. Switch into AUTO mode. Now the TAKEOFF "
"command will be activated and the plane will go to :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` "
"even though the throttle stick is at idle. Toss it and it will climb "
"straight up to desired altitude. It will then go into RTL since no other "
"waypoint is loaded. Be sure to move the throttle stick from idle to midstick"
" after launch to avoid unexpected throttle idle if you have to switch to "
"STAB or MANUAL for some reason. Also be prepared for another "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` climb to the RTL altitude (RTL_ALTITUDE) if your "
"TAKEOFF altitude is below this."
msgstr ""
"同时重新检查电池的放置位置是否满足所需重心。解锁飞机并准备好投掷起飞。切换到 AUTO 模式，TAKEOFF "
"命令将被激活，即使油门摇杆处于怠速位置，飞机也将以 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` 运行。投掷后飞机将垂直爬升到所需高度，然后进入 "
"RTL 模式（因为未载入其他航点）。请确保在投掷后将油门摇杆从怠速移至中位，以避免在因某种原因需切换到 STAB 或 MANUAL "
"时出现意外油门怠速。同时，若起飞高度低于 RTL 高度（RTL_ALTITUDE），需做好再次以 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` 爬升到"
" RTL 高度的准备。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:272 831d57987e59493aad65b42a765ebbb4
msgid ""
"Now switch to CRUISE mode and let the airframe cruise level without input "
"for several intervals of ten seconds. This allows the "
":ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>` function to adjust the servo trims "
"accordingly. After having performed level flight with no inputs for a "
"sufficiently long accumulated periods (trim is updated every 10 seconds of "
"flight with no pilot inputs), switch into Manual mode to verify correct "
"trims are now set."
msgstr ""
"切换到 CRUISE 模式，让机架在无输入的情况下平稳巡航若干个十秒间隔。这使得 "
":ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>` 功能能够相应调整舵机配平。在无飞手输入的平飞累计足够长时间后（每 10 "
"秒无飞手输入更新一次配平），切换到 Manual 模式以确认正确的配平已被设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:275 3e89cb4ae36a4a8096be11987beaa9fc
msgid ""
"Then check all the other flight modes one by one. Check FS behaviour also."
msgstr "然后逐一检查所有其他飞行模式，并检查失控保护行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/fpv-plane.rst:277 c16966d670364c199084005db1771a4b
msgid ""
"At this point the plane should be flyable and well trimmed. Now you can "
"explore all the other features of ArduPilot and tweak your setup to personal"
" preferences. If you elect to use AUTOTUNE, be sure to read its "
"`documentation <automatic-tuning-with-autotune.html>`__ thoroughly. Failing "
"to run the autotune procedures as recommended bears the risk to decrease , "
"rather than increase, your airframe's flight handling characteristics."
msgstr ""
"此时飞机应已可正常飞行并调整到位。现在可以探索 ArduPilot 的所有其他功能，并根据个人偏好调整配置。若要使用 AUTOTUNE，请务必彻底阅读其"
" `文档 <automatic-tuning-with-"
"autotune.html>`__。未按建议运行自动调参程序将有降低而非提升机架飞行操控特性的风险。"

